# Not copied by server/Dockerfile and not needed by the API/worker image --
# excluded so a `railway up` upload (and any docker build context) stays
# small instead of shipping ~110 MB of Android/ML artifacts. tools/ is still
# copied in full; only tools/verify_assistance_assets.py reaches into these
# directories, and that is a host-side CI check, never run in the container.
